》","text":"樊稠请益兵东出李傕会杀","evidence":["dongyuan-e-p042b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"xunyu-p0100","role":"请兵被杀","evidence":["dongyuan-e-p042b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0089","role":"诱杀","evidence":["dongyuan-e-p042b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"樊稠追韩遂后","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["dongyuan-e-p042b-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"dongyuan-e-p042b-q","source_order":[6,158,"P042b"],"order":1569},{"id":"xunyu-e-p048a","title":"贾诩责止李傕郭汜樊稠相斗","accounts":[{"id":"xunyu-e-p048a-account","label":"《献帝纪》","text":"郭汜、樊稠与李傕多次欲斗，贾诩以道理责止，诸人颇受其言。","evidence":["xunyu-e-p048a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0182","role":"调解选官","evidence":["xunyu-e-p048a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0089","role":"受劝","evidence":["xunyu-e-p048a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0090","role":"受劝","evidence":["xunyu-e-p048a-q"]},{"person":"xunyu-p0100","role":"受劝","evidence":["xunyu-e-p048a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"贾诩典选时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["xunyu-e-p048a-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"xunyu-e-p048a-q","source_order":[10,294,"P048a"],"order":2514}],"persons":[{"id":"xunyu-p0100","name":"樊稠","evidence":["xunyu-q-p048","dongyuan-q-o017"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"xunyu-m-p048-xunyu-p0100","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xunyu-q-p048"]},{"id":"dongyuan-m-o017-xunyu-p0100","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["dongyuan-q-o017"]},{"id":"dongyuan-m-o018-xunyu-p0100","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["dongyuan-q-o018"]},{"id":"dongyuan-m-o020-xunyu-p0100","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["dongyuan-q-o020"]},{"id":"dongyuan-m-o022-xunyu-p0100","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["dongyuan-q-o022"]},{"id":"dongyuan-m-p042-xunyu-p0100","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["dongyuan-q-p042"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dongyuan-e-o017d-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-693e72937b34d2f18740","layer":"original","quote":"比傕等还，辅已败，众无所依。欲各散归，既无赦书，而闻长安中欲尽诛凉州人〖3〗，忧恐不知所为。用贾诩策，遂将其众而西；所在收兵，比至长安，众十余万。﹝二﹞与卓故部曲樊稠、李蒙、王方等，合围长安城。十日城陷，与布战城中，布败走。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":128,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":152,"end":264,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-e-o018c-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-03f807b91941fde0ac22","layer":"original","quote":"傕为车骑将军，池阳侯，领司隶校尉，假节；汜为后将军，美阳侯；稠为右将军，万年侯。傕、汜、稠擅朝政。﹝四﹞济为骠骑将军，平阳侯，屯弘农。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":129,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":64,"end":131,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-e-o020b-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-65b670a144babbf47c8b","layer":"original","quote":"腾引兵至长平观〖3〗，宇等谋泄，出奔槐里〖4〗。稠击腾，腾败走，还凉州。又攻槐里，宇等皆死。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":144,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":42,"end":88,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-e-o022a-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-071bf4ad22608adb7a74","layer":"original","quote":"诸将争权，遂杀稠，并其众。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":146,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":13,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-e-p042a-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-357a68ca6508bf3a949a","layer":"pei","quote":"马腾、韩遂之败，樊稠追至陈仓。遂语稠曰：‘天地反覆，未可知也。本所争者，非私怨，王家事耳。与足下州里人，今虽小违，要当大同；欲相与善语，以别。邂逅万一不如意，后可复相见乎？’俱却骑，前接马，交臂相加，共语良久而别。傕兄子利，随稠，利还告傕：韩、樊交马语，不知所道，意爱甚密。傕以是疑稠与韩遂私和而有异意。","attribution":"《九州春秋》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":157,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-6d29d2a4a09de81e32db","start":12,"end":164,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-e-p042b-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-357a68ca6508bf3a949a","layer":"pei","quote":"稠欲将兵东出关，从傕索益兵。因请稠会议，便于坐杀稠。","attribution":"《九州春秋》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":157,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-6d29d2a4a09de81e32db","start":164,"end":190,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-o017","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-693e72937b34d2f18740","layer":"original","quote":"初，卓女婿中郎将牛辅，典兵别屯陕〖1〗；分遣校尉李傕、郭汜、张济，略陈留、颍川诸县。卓死，吕布使李肃至陕，欲以诏命诛辅。辅等逆与肃战；肃败，走弘农，布诛肃。﹝一﹞其后辅营兵有夜叛出者，营中惊。辅以为皆叛，乃取金宝，独与素所厚（友）〔支〕胡赤儿等五六人相随〖2〗，逾城，北渡河。赤儿等利其金宝，斩首送长安。比傕等还，辅已败，众无所依。欲各散归，既无赦书，而闻长安中欲尽诛凉州人〖3〗，忧恐不知所为。用贾诩策，遂将其众而西；所在收兵，比至长安，众十余万。﹝二﹞与卓故部曲樊稠、李蒙、王方等，合围长安城。十日城陷，与布战城中，布败走。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":128,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":264,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-o018","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-03f807b91941fde0ac22","layer":"original","quote":"傕等放兵，略长安老少，杀之悉尽，死者狼藉。诛杀卓者，尸王允于市〖4〗。﹝三﹞葬卓于郿。大风暴雨震卓墓；水流入藏〖5〗，漂其棺椁。傕为车骑将军，池阳侯，领司隶校尉，假节；汜为后将军，美阳侯；稠为右将军，万年侯。傕、汜、稠擅朝政。﹝四﹞济为骠骑将军，平阳侯，屯弘农。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":129,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":131,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-o020","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-65b670a144babbf47c8b","layer":"original","quote":"侍中马宇，与谏议大夫种邵〖2〗、左中郎将刘范等谋：欲使腾袭长安，己为内应，以诛傕等。腾引兵至长平观〖3〗，宇等谋泄，出奔槐里〖4〗。稠击腾，腾败走，还凉州。又攻槐里，宇等皆死。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":144,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":88,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-o022","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-071bf4ad22608adb7a74","layer":"original","quote":"诸将争权，遂杀稠，并其众。﹝二﹞汜与傕转相疑，战斗长安中〖5〗。﹝三﹞傕质天子于营，烧宫殿城门；略官寺〖6〗，尽收乘舆服御物置其家〖7〗。﹝四﹞傕使公卿诣汜，请和；汜皆执之。﹝五﹞相攻击连月，死者万数。﹝六﹞","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":146,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":104,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-p042","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-357a68ca6508bf3a949a","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《九州春秋》曰：“马腾、韩遂之败，樊稠追至陈仓。遂语稠曰：‘天地反覆，未可知也。本所争者，非私怨，王家事耳。与足下州里人，今虽小违，要当大同；欲相与善语，以别。邂逅万一不如意，后可复相见乎？’俱却骑，前接马，交臂相加，共语良久而别。傕兄子利，随稠，利还告傕：韩、樊交马语，不知所道，意爱甚密。傕以是疑稠与韩遂私和而有异意。稠欲将兵东出关，从傕索益兵。因请稠会议，便于坐杀稠。”","attribution":"《九州春秋》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":157,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-6d29d2a4a09de81e32db","start":0,"end":191,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liuermu-q-1466895033a283fd6cf9","section":"chapter-031","block":"b-2c5766a2ece813cd392f","layer":"pei","quote":"焉使校尉孙肇将兵往助之，败于长安","attribution":"裴注·英雄记","section_title":"刘二牧传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0068.xhtml","index":65,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-fb120b735013343cd719","start":26,"end":42,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liuermu-q-5a71157554d998de3c5d","section":"chapter-031","block":"b-bccefe4727ae6d26d31c","layer":"original","quote":"范谋泄，奔槐里","section_title":"刘二牧传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0068.xhtml","index":38,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":51,"end":58,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liuermu-q-68261176cce55bc27ddd","section":"chapter-031","block":"b-bccefe4727ae6d26d31c","layer":"original","quote":"腾败，退还凉州","section_title":"刘二牧传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0068.xhtml","index":38,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":63,"end":70,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liuermu-q-bb06a23090492218c640","section":"chapter-031","block":"b-bccefe4727ae6d26d31c","layer":"original","quote":"范应时见杀","section_title":"刘二牧传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0068.xhtml","index":38,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":71,"end":76,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liuermu-q-d113123fca3ef319bc15","section":"chapter-031","block":"b-bccefe4727ae6d26d31c","layer":"original","quote":"于是收诞行刑","section_title":"刘二牧传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0068.xhtml","index":38,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":77,"end":83,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-e-p048a-q","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-c403c424e818825effff","layer":"pei","quote":"郭汜、樊稠，与傕互相违戾，欲斗者数矣。诩辄以道理责之，颇受诩言。","attribution":"《献帝纪》","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":293,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-6bbbeec85ad9dfaf1546","start":11,"end":43,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-q-p048","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-c403c424e818825effff","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《献帝纪》曰：“郭汜、樊稠，与傕互相违戾，欲斗者数矣。诩辄以道理责之，颇受诩言。”《魏书》曰：“诩典选举，多选旧名，以为令、仆。论者以此多诩。”","attribution":"《献帝纪》《魏书》","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":293,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-6bbbeec85ad9dfaf1546","start":0,"end":75,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
